/Documents/RenderDocs/skills/kk-scene-pipeline-setup/agents/*
/Documents/RenderDocs/skills/kk-scene-pipeline-setup/references/*
/Documents/RenderDocs/skills/kk-scene-pipeline-setup/assets/*
